<title>UK: BOE allots 148 mln stg in repo, shortage 1.4 bln.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 148 mln stg in repo, shortage 1.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 148 million stg of assistance in 6.0 percent repos to May 13 and 14.</p>
<p>The Bank forecast a liquidity shortage of 1.4 billion stg.</p>
</text>
